# Documentation only: the app does not load .env files.
# Proposed AUTH-03B mapping: supply public values through --dart-define.
# ANDRIL_ENV: development (default), staging, or production.
# ANDRIL_SUPABASE_URL: approved hosted project HTTPS URL, without an API path.
# ANDRIL_SUPABASE_PUBLIC_KEY: public publishable key or legacy anon-role JWT.
# ANDRIL_API_BASE_URL: approved absolute HTTPS backend base URL.
# No production values, privileged keys, credentials or user tokens belong here.
# Environment/project namespaces isolate secure session and PKCE persistence.
# See docs/AUTH_03B.md for validation, limitations and later-batch dependencies.
